# Stylesheets are the only thing this repository formats. The dense one-line style in its .ts and
# .tsx is a deliberate choice that three independent contributors reproduced correctly on first
# contact, so a formatter run over them would rewrite the codebase to settle a question nobody
# asked. Listing what is never formatted, rather than what is, means `prettier --write .` is safe.
**/*.ts
**/*.tsx
**/*.mts
**/*.js
**/*.mjs
**/*.json
**/*.md
**/*.yml
dist/
node_modules/
